  {t="A", seg=2, q={95041}, names={"Data Hoarders"}, text="Jemma Quikswitch, in Tinker Town (needs level 7)", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=67.7, y=44.2},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={97263}, names={"Your Package Has Arrived"}, text="Eldrun Stormbreaker, the Ironforge shaman trainer, at the north end of the city", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=47.6, y=13.5},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=2, text="Eldrun Stormbreaker: learn your level 8 spells (Stoneclaw Totem, Lightning Shield and new ranks of Lightning Bolt, Earth Shock and Rockbiter Weapon). Not 8 yet? Ingrid in Kharanos teaches them later", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=47.6, y=13.5},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={287}, names={"Frostmane Hold"}, text="Leave Ironforge and take the road west past Kharanos and Brewnall. Frostmane Hold is the troll cave in the far west of Dun Morogh, south-west of Iceflow Lake. Kill 5 Frostmane Headhunters (8-9) around and inside it and walk into the cave until the explore objective ticks. Headhunters throw from range: run up to them. Earthbind Totem if one flees", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=25.4, y=50.4},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={412,95041}, names={"Operation Recombobulation","Data Hoarders"}, text="North of the hold, in front of the Gnomeregan entrance: Leper Gnomes (8-10) drop the Restabilization Cogs and Gyromechanic Gears (8 of each). The 7 Gnomeregan Archival Data cards lie in the snow around the same camp: look for small objects on the ground between the gnomes. Stoneform clears the gnomes' disease", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=26.0, y=40.4},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={311}, names={"Return to Marleth"}, text="Marleth Barleybrew, in Brewnall Village on the way back east", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=30.2, y=45.5},
  {t="H", seg=2, arg="Kharanos", text="Hearthstone still on cooldown? Walk the road east instead"},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={287}, names={"Frostmane Hold"}, text="Senir Whitebeard", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=46.7, y=53.8},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={291}, names={"The Reports"}, zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=46.7, y=53.8},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={412}, names={"Operation Recombobulation"}, text="Razzle Sprysprocket", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=45.9, y=49.4},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=2, text="Ingrid Dunwald: learn your level 8 spells if you have not yet. Already level 10? Leave Call of Fire for the next segment and learn the level 10 spells with it", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=47.4, y=52.0},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={291}, names={"The Reports"}, text="Senator Barin Redstone, in the High Seat (the king's hall) on the west side of Ironforge", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=39.6, y=57.5},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={95041}, names={"Data Hoarders"}, text="Jemma Quikswitch, in Tinker Town", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=67.7, y=44.2},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99158}, names={"Dawn in the Mountains"}, text="Leave Ironforge by the gate, go down the ramp and turn east off the road: Father Gavin's cabin, Misty Pine Refuge, stands on the mountainside south-east of the Gates of Ironforge", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.7, y=44.8},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99159}, names={"Finding Warmth"}, text="Father Gavin", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.7, y=44.8},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99159}, names={"Finding Warmth"}, text="Collect 14 Mostly Dry Firewood: pick it up from the ground around the refuge and under the pines nearby (exact spots are not in our data, so look around the cabin first)", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.0, y=45.5},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99159}, names={"Finding Warmth"}, zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.7, y=44.8},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99160,99162}, names={"Rime's Wrath","Treacherous Cold"}, text="Father Gavin gives both", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.7, y=44.8},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99160,99162}, names={"Rime's Wrath","Treacherous Cold"}, text="Minor Ice Elementals drift over the snow slide around the refuge and west toward the Ironforge road (49-58, 42-50): kill 10. While you hunt, look for the bodies of three fallen mountaineers in the same snow field and take Stoneanvil's, Sunhammer's and Coalbeard's Rifle (their spots are not in our data)", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=55.1, y=45.3},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99160,99162}, names={"Rime's Wrath","Treacherous Cold"}, text="Father Gavin", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.7, y=44.8},
  {t="A", seg=2, q={99161}, names={"Rime's Wrath"}, zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.7, y=44.8},
  {t="C", seg=2, q={99161}, names={"Rime's Wrath"}, text="Avala is the large ice elemental just north of the refuge, up the slope. Fight it at full health and mana with Stoneskin Totem down; Healing Wave when you drop below half. Loot Avala's Core", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.6, y=42.6},
  {t="T", seg=2, q={99161}, names={"Rime's Wrath"}, text="Father Gavin", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=57.7, y=44.8},
  {t="L", seg=2, lvl=10, text="Not level 10 yet? Kill ice elementals, boars and leopards around the refuge until you are: the next segment starts with Call of Fire in Kharanos, which needs level 10. Then walk back south-west to Kharanos", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=55.1, y=45.3},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={94449}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Ingrid Dunwald, the shaman trainer in Kharanos (needs level 10): Call of Fire", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=47.4, y=52.0},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=3, text="Ingrid Dunwald: learn your level 10 spells (Flame Shock, Strength of Earth Totem, Flametongue Weapon). Sell and repair in Kharanos: the next vendors are at the quarry", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=47.4, y=52.0},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={96408}, names={"A Visitor to Dun Morogh"}, text="Beldin Steelgrill, at Steelgrill's Depot just north-east of Kharanos", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=50.4, y=49.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={95212}, names={"Never Saddle on Quality"}, text="Follow the road east to Amberstill Ranch: Rudra Amberstill. The pelts come from the leopards east of the quarry, together with the trogg quests", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=63.1, y=49.7},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={96408}, names={"A Visitor to Dun Morogh"}, text="Earthseer Farsen's campsite is on the hillside south of the ranch, overlooking the Gol'Bolar Quarry from the west", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.8, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={96392}, names={"Farsen's Watch"}, zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={96392}, names={"Farsen's Watch"}, text="Talk to Farsen again and ask for his far sight; watch the vision until the objective ticks", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.8, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={96392}, names={"Farsen's Watch"}, zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={96390}, names={"Nip 'Em in the Bud"}, text="Farsen: 10 Dark Iron Spies at Ironband's Compound, east of the quarry", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={432}, names={"Those Blasted Troggs!"}, text="Foreman Stonebrow, at the quarry camp", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=56.3},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={433}, names={"The Public Servant"}, text="Senator Mehr Stonehallow, next to him", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=68.7, y=56.0},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={95214}, names={"Stolen Blasting Powder"}, text="Quarrymaster Thesten, on the north side of the camp. If he offers nothing, kill troggs until one drops an Empty Powder Keg, right-click it and bring it to him first (a small extra quest)", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=54.9},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={432}, names={"Those Blasted Troggs!"}, text="Rockjaw Skullthumpers (8-9) fill the quarry pit right beside the camp: kill 6. Every trogg here can drop Stolen Blasting Powder", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=70.3, y=55.9},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={433,95214,95212}, names={"The Public Servant","Stolen Blasting Powder","Never Saddle on Quality"}, text="Work east out of the quarry: kill 10 Rockjaw Bonesnappers (9-10) and keep killing troggs until you have 16 Stolen Blasting Powder. The big snow leopards on the slopes east and south-east of the quarry (70-78, 50-63) drop the 6 Pristine Leopard Pelts. Troggs stand close together: pull with Lightning Bolt, Stoneclaw Totem when two come", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=73.6, y=55.4},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={96390}, names={"Nip 'Em in the Bud"}, text="Ironband's Compound, the walled yard south-east of the quarry: kill 10 Dark Iron Spies (9-10). They are stealthed around the buildings, so walk slowly and let them come to you. Lightning Shield up, Healing Wave between fights", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=77.5, y=60.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={96391}, names={"Underground Map"}, text="One of the spies drops a Dark Iron Map: right-click it in your bags to start this quest. No map after 10 spies? Kill a few more", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=77.5, y=60.8},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={432}, names={"Those Blasted Troggs!"}, text="Foreman Stonebrow, back at the quarry camp", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=56.3},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={433}, names={"The Public Servant"}, text="Senator Mehr Stonehallow", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=68.7, y=56.0},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={95214}, names={"Stolen Blasting Powder"}, text="Quarrymaster Thesten. Sell and repair at the camp", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=69.1, y=54.9},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={96390}, names={"Nip 'Em in the Bud"}, text="Earthseer Farsen, on the hillside west of the quarry", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={96391}, names={"Underground Map"}, text="Farsen. Do NOT take his next quest (Old Ironforge Incursion): it is a dungeon", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=64.9, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={95212}, names={"Never Saddle on Quality"}, text="Rudra Amberstill, at Amberstill Ranch north of Farsen's camp", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=63.0, y=49.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={419}, names={"The Lost Pilot"}, text="Follow the road east and take the left (northern) branch to North Gate Outpost: Pilot Hammerfoot", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=83.9, y=39.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={419}, names={"The Lost Pilot"}, text="A Dwarven Corpse lies in the snow west of the outpost, on the slope north of the road", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=79.7, y=36.2},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={417}, names={"A Pilot's Revenge"}, text="From the corpse", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=79.7, y=36.2},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={417}, names={"A Pilot's Revenge"}, text="Mangeclaw (level 11 bear) prowls right next to the corpse. Fight him at full health: Stoneskin Totem down, Flame Shock, then melee. Loot the Mangy Claw", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=78.3, y=37.8},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={417}, names={"A Pilot's Revenge"}, text="Pilot Hammerfoot, back at North Gate Outpost", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=83.9, y=39.2},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={413}, names={"Shimmer Stout"}, text="Back to the fork and east to South Gate Outpost: Mountaineer Barleybrew", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=86.3, y=48.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={414}, names={"Stout to Kadrell"}, text="Keep it: Mountaineer Kadrell is in Thelsamar", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=86.3, y=48.8},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={94449}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Bruegs Kindleborn is in a cave on the mountainside above South Gate Outpost, to the north: look for the path up from the outpost", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=87.6, y=43.7},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={94465}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="He gives you the Torch of the Dormant Flame", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=87.6, y=43.7},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={224}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Go through the South Gate Pass tunnels into Loch Modan. Mountaineer Cobbleflint is at the guard tower in the Valley of Kings, just past the last tunnel", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=22.1, y=73.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={267}, names={"The Trogg Threat"}, text="Captain Rugelfuss, inside the tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.2, y=73.7},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={94465}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Braldir Ashmantle guards the Shrine of the Dormant Flame, on a peak in the crags east of the Valley of Kings. A hidden path leads up to him from the trogg hills: follow the arrow and look for the trail up the slope", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=32.1, y=66.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={94466}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="He needs 1 Reagent Pouch (Stonesplinter Seers, here in the south) and 1 Fire Tar (Tunnel Rat Geomancers, in the mine up north, later)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=32.1, y=66.1},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={224}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Stonesplinter Valley, the trogg hills around and south of the shrine: kill 10 Stonesplinter Troggs and 10 Stonesplinter Scouts (11-12). Every trogg can drop a Trogg Stone Tooth", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=30.8, y=68.2},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={94466}, obj={2}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Stonesplinter Seers (13-14) stand in the southern end of the valley (27-36, 81-90): kill them until one drops the Reagent Pouch. They are 2-3 levels above you: pull one alone, Earth Shock its Lightning Bolt, Stoneskin Totem, and back off to heal if a second joins", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=31.0, y=84.0},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={267}, names={"The Trogg Threat"}, text="Finish 8 Trogg Stone Teeth on any troggs on the way back north-west to the tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=30.8, y=70.0, path={{30.4,79.5},{32.6,76.2},{32.8,72.9}}},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={224}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Cobbleflint, at the southern guard tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=22.1, y=73.1},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={267}, names={"The Trogg Threat"}, text="Captain Rugelfuss", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.2, y=73.7},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={237}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Gravelgaw, a little south of the tower. You do this one at the end of the segment", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.5, y=76.4},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={414}, names={"Stout to Kadrell"}, text="Follow the road north-east to Thelsamar: Mountaineer Kadrell patrols the main street", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.2, y=47.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={416,1339}, names={"Rat Catching","Mountaineer Stormpike's Task"}, text="Kadrell gives both", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.2, y=47.8},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn (Stoutlager Inn)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.8, y=49.3},
  {t="S", seg=3, arg="Thelsamar", text="Make the inn your home: talk to Innkeeper Hearthstove"},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={6387}, names={"Honor Students"}, text="Brock Stoneseeker, in the house at the east end of town (dwarves and gnomes only)", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=37.0, y=47.8},
  {t="N", seg=3, arg="Grenhild Darktalon in Thelsamar offers Snowbound (a jar of snow from the South Gate Pass to the north shore). Skip it: it does not fit this loop"},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={6387}, names={"Honor Students"}, text="Thorgrum Borrelson, the gryphon master on the south side of town", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.9, y=51.0},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={6391}, names={"Ride to Ironforge"}, zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.9, y=51.0},
