  {t="FLY", seg=3, arg="Ironforge"},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={6391}, names={"Ride to Ironforge"}, text="Golnir Bouldertoe, at the Great Forge, north of where you land", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=51.5, y=26.3},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={6388}, names={"Gryth Thurden"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=51.5, y=26.3},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=3, text="Eldrun Stormbreaker, at the north end of the city: learn your level 12 spells (Healing Wave rank 3, Purge, Ancestral Spirit). Sell, repair and buy water in the city", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=47.6, y=13.5},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={2039}, names={"Find Bingles"}, text="Gnoarn, in Tinker Town on the east side (needs level 12). Keep it: Bingles is on the east shore of the Loch, a later segment. Not 12 yet? Skip it for now: you are back in Ironforge at the start of the next segment", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=69.2, y=50.6},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={6388}, names={"Gryth Thurden"}, text="Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=55.5, y=47.7},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={6392}, names={"Return to Brock"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=55.5, y=47.7},
  {t="FLY", seg=3, arg="Thelsamar"},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={6392}, names={"Return to Brock"}, text="Brock Stoneseeker, at the east end of Thelsamar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=37.0, y=47.8},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="On the way north kill Elder Black Bears (Bear Meat), Mountain Boars (Boar Intestines) and Forest Lurkers (Spider Ichor) beside the road: 3 of each item", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=31.5, y=39.0},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={1339}, names={"Mountaineer Stormpike's Task"}, text="Mountaineer Stormpike, at the top of the northern guard tower (Algaz Station), in the north-west corner of the zone", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=24.8, y=18.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={307,1338}, names={"Filthy Paws","Stormpike's Order"}, text="Stormpike gives both. Keep Stormpike's Order: it goes to Stormwind next segment", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=24.8, y=18.4},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={307,416,94466}, obj={0,0,1}, names={"Filthy Paws","Rat Catching","Call of Fire"}, text="Silver Stream Mine, the kobold cave east of the tower. Open 4 Miners' League Crates inside for the Miners' Gear, cut 12 Tunnel Rat Ears from any kobold (they also stand outside the mine), and kill Tunnel Rat Geomancers (12-13, deep in the mine) until one drops the Fire Tar. Geomancers cast fire: Earth Shock them. Kobolds flee at low health: Earthbind Totem", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=35.5, y=24.3, path={{35.3,18.7}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={307}, names={"Filthy Paws"}, text="Back west to Mountaineer Stormpike", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=24.8, y=18.4},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="Finish the sausage meats on the walk back south to Thelsamar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.0, y=31.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={416}, names={"Rat Catching"}, text="Mountaineer Kadrell, in Thelsamar", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.2, y=47.8},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={418}, names={"Thelsamar Blood Sausages"}, text="Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn. Sell and repair before you leave", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=34.8, y=49.3},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={94466}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="South again, up the hidden path to Braldir Ashmantle", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=32.1, y=66.1},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={94467}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="He gives you a Fire Sapta", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=32.1, y=66.1},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={94467}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Drink the Fire Sapta at the shrine, then climb to the peak. The Minor Manifestation of Fire does not attack until you do: start at full health and mana, Stoneskin Totem down, Earth Shock on cooldown, and kill it fast (it gets stronger the longer you wait). Loot the Glowing Ember", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=31.9, y=64.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={94467}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Click the Brazier of the Dormant Flame on the peak", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=31.9, y=64.5},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={94468}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="The brazier gives you the Torch of the Eternal Flame", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=31.9, y=64.5},
  {t="C", seg=3, q={237}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Kill 10 Stonesplinter Skullthumpers and 10 Stonesplinter Seers (13-14) in the hills south of the shrine. One at a time: Earth Shock the Seers' casts, Stoneclaw Totem if you get an add, Healing Wave between pulls", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=33.0, y=76.0},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={237}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Gravelgaw, a little south of the southern guard tower", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.5, y=76.4},
  {t="A", seg=3, q={263}, names={"In Defense of the King's Lands"}, text="Mountaineer Wallbang, at the tower. Keep it: the Shamans and Bonesnappers are level 15-16, for your next Loch Modan visit", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=23.5, y=74.5},
  {t="T", seg=3, q={94468}, names={"Call of Fire"}, text="Walk back west through the South Gate Pass tunnels and up to Bruegs Kindleborn above South Gate Outpost. You get the Fire Totem (keep it in your bags) and learn Searing Totem", zone="Dun Morogh", map=1426, x=87.6, y=43.7},
  {t="H", seg=3, arg="Thelsamar", text="The next segment starts with the gryphon from Thelsamar to Ironforge"},
  {t="FLY", seg=4, arg="Ironforge", text="From Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar"},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=4, text="Eldrun Stormbreaker, at the north end of Ironforge: learn your level 14 spells (new ranks of Lightning Bolt, Earth Shock and Stoneskin Totem). There is no known shaman trainer in Stormwind, so do not skip this. Sell, repair, buy water", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=47.6, y=13.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={96394}, names={"The Restless Dead"}, text="Afadra Dunwall. Kill 15 Enraged Apparitions and 10 Tormented Souls and put the spirit of Anvilmar to rest.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=33.1, y=47.9, dg=1},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={96403}, names={"Important Heirlooms"}, text="Thom Filch. Collect 8 Dwarven Heirlooms inside.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=32.4, y=44.8, dg=1},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Optional dungeon: Hall of Thanes, levels 13-18", text="The entrance is beneath Old Ironforge. Inside: the Ghostly Attendant gives An Ancient Grudge, and a stone tablet behind the vault door of the last room (easy to walk past on the way to the exit lever) starts The Treaty of Understanding for King Magni. Earthseer Farsen (Dun Morogh 64.9, 58.4) gives Old Ironforge Incursion, but only after the Underground Map quest from a Dark Iron Map item. Quests you picked up for it: The Restless Dead, Important Heirlooms.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=27.6, y=47.8, dg=1, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={96394}, names={"The Restless Dead"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=33.3, y=47.7, dg=1},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={96403}, names={"Important Heirlooms"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=32.4, y=44.9, dg=1},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Could not take Find Bingles last time (it needs level 12)? Take it now from Gnoarn in Tinker Town (Ironforge 69.2, 50.6) and keep it for a later Loch Modan visit"},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={6661}, names={"Deeprun Rat Roundup"}, text="Enter the Deeprun Tram through the big doorway in Tinker Town. Monty stands on the Ironforge platform between the tracks"},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={6661}, names={"Deeprun Rat Roundup"}, text="Use the Rat Catcher's Flute on 5 Deeprun Rats on and around the platform; they follow you. Walk them back to Monty"},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={6661}, names={"Deeprun Rat Roundup"}, text="Monty"},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={6662}, names={"Me Brother, Nipsy"}},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={6662}, names={"Me Brother, Nipsy"}, text="Ride the tram to the Stormwind end. Nipsy stands on that platform"},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={1338}, names={"Stormpike's Order"}, text="Furen Longbeard, in the Dwarven District, where the tram lets you out", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=64.6, y=37.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={97894}, names={"Business in Auberdine"}, text="Borgus Steelhand, in the Dwarven District (needs level 13). Just a message for his brother in Auberdine: you carry it until the route gets there by boat", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=59.4, y=34.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={2040}, names={"Underground Assault"}, text="Shoni the Shilent. The Gnoam Sprecklesprocket drops from Sneed's Shredder.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=55.5, y=12.5, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={399}, names={"Humble Beginnings"}, text="Baros Alexston, in Cathedral Square", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=57.7, y=47.9},
  {t="N", seg=4, arg="Buy 1 Shiny Bauble and 3 Nightcrawlers from Catherine Leland, the fishing supplier on the canal just west of the Trade District (Stormwind City 55.1, 69.8). They are for the old fisherman at the harbor"},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={97234}, names={"Reading Room"}, text="Roy Lewells, in the Park on the west side of the city (needs level 13)", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=38.7, y=62.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={95065}, names={"Fishin' Time"}, text="Gilbert Gray, fishing at the harbor on the far west side", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=26.3, y=47.1},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={95065}, names={"Fishin' Time"}, text="Hand him the bauble and the nightcrawlers right away", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=26.3, y=47.1},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={97220}, names={"Philmor's Favor"}, text="Manifest Clerk Philmor, at the docks north of Gilbert (follow the arrow). If he offers nothing, skip this quest and Gatehouse Goods", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=30.4, y=29.1},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={97234}, names={"Reading Room"}, text="Cross the city to Stormwind Keep: Donyal Tovald, the librarian, in the keep's library", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=75.2, y=30.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={97237}, names={"Shelf Picked"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=75.2, y=30.3},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={97237}, names={"Shelf Picked"}, text="Find the four books on the shelves and tables of the library: Field Accounts of Horde Razings, Trollbane Conquests, The Forsaken Ally and Cycles of Morality. Keep the quest: Roy gets them when you come back from Westfall", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=75.2, y=30.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={168}, names={"Collecting Memories"}, text="Wilder Thistlenettle. 4 Miners' Union Cards from the undead miners in the tunnels before the dungeon portal.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=65.4, y=21.2, dg=2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={167}, names={"Oh Brother. . ."}, text="Wilder Thistlenettle. The badge drops from Foreman Thistlenettle, in the tunnels before the portal.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=65.4, y=21.2, dg=2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={97220}, names={"Philmor's Favor"}, text="Elaine Trias, in Trias' Cheese in the Trade District", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={97222}, names={"Gatehouse Goods"}, text="Elaine Trias", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={97222}, names={"Gatehouse Goods"}, text="Carry the Gatehouse Shipment up the stairs inside the cheese shop and put it down outside the stockroom door on the upper floor", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={97222}, names={"Gatehouse Goods"}, text="Elaine Trias", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=66.6, y=73.5},
  {t="F", seg=4, arg="Stormwind", text="Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master in the Trade District. You fly back here from Westfall"},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={1097}, names={"Elmore's Task"}, text="Leave by the main gate and follow the road south to Goldshire: Smith Argus, in the smithy. Keep it for Grimand Elmore in Stormwind at the end of the segment", zone="Elwynn Forest", map=1429, x=41.7, y=65.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={64}, names={"The Forgotten Heirloom"}, text="Take the road west from Goldshire, past Westbrook Garrison and over the bridge into Westfall. Farmer Furlbrow stands at a cart just past the bridge", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=60.0, y=19.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={109}, names={"Report to Gryan Stoutmantle"}, text="Farmer Furlbrow", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=60.0, y=19.4},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={36,151}, names={"Westfall Stew","Poor Old Blanchy"}, text="Verna Furlbrow, next to him", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=59.9, y=19.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={36}, names={"Westfall Stew"}, text="Follow the road south to Saldean's Farm: Salma Saldean, in the farmhouse", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=30.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={38,22}, names={"Westfall Stew","Goretusk Liver Pie"}, text="Salma gives both", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=30.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={9}, names={"The Killing Fields"}, text="Farmer Saldean, outside by the field", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.0, y=31.2},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={92909}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Ozwin Ironsprocket, a gnome hiding in the stable west of the Saldean farmhouse", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=51.6, y=32.2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={109}, names={"Report to Gryan Stoutmantle"}, text="Gryan Stoutmantle, in the stone tower on Sentinel Hill", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5, path={{49.6,34.3},{49.6,37.9},{53.4,40.6},{55.4,43.6},{55.4,47.2}}},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={12}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Gryan Stoutmantle", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.3, y=47.5},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={102}, names={"Patrolling Westfall"}, text="Captain Danuvin, next to Gryan", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=47.6},
  {t="F", seg=4, arg="Sentinel Hill", text="Thor, the gryphon master just south of the tower"},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={153}, names={"Red Leather Bandanas"}, text="Scout Galiaan, south-west of the tower, near the inn", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=54.0, y=53.0},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={92742,92744}, names={"Testing the Wells","Murloc Gills"}, text="Alba Fairmoon, by the inn. She gives both and a Well Water Sample Kit", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="S", seg=4, arg="Sentinel Hill", text="Make the inn your home: talk to Innkeeper Heather"},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={92909}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Head west into the fields around the Alexston Farmstead. Harvest Golems and Harvest Watchers drop the Golem Isosprings (14) and Harvester Gyrostabilizers (5), and also Okra for the stew and Flasks of Oil: keep 5 oil for the lighthouse. Watchers count for the Saldeans (20). Kill Goretusks for livers and snouts and Fleshrippers for Stringy Vulture Meat wherever you see them, and open every Sack of Oats (8 needed) on the farms. Harvesters hit hard: Stoneskin Totem, Earth Shock, Healing Wave between pulls", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=39.0, y=50.0},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={92910}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="A harvester drops a Precessive Autocognition Assembly: right-click it in your bags to start this quest. If none has dropped by the time the parts are done, never mind", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=39.0, y=50.0},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={92742}, obj={2}, names={"Testing the Wells"}, text="North to the Molsen Farm (the position is approximate: it is the farm with harvesters north of the Alexston fields). Stand at the well in the yard and use the Well Water Sample Kit. Keep killing Harvest Watchers in its fields", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=44.0, y=35.0},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={12}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="Kill 15 Defias Trappers and 15 Defias Smugglers (11-13). They stand around the Molsen Farm, the Jangolode Mine to the north and Furlbrow's Pumpkin Farm. They drop Red Leather Bandanas (15 needed in all, from any Defias). Riverpaw gnolls up here drop Gnoll Paws (8). Defias run at low health: Earthbind Totem", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=45.0, y=26.0},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={64}, names={"The Forgotten Heirloom"}, text="Furlbrow's Pumpkin Farm, east of the mine: the pocket watch is in the wardrobe inside the farmhouse. Defias inside: pull them out one at a time", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=49.3, y=19.3},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={92744}, names={"Murloc Gills"}, text="The coast north of the pumpkin farm (Longshore): kill murlocs (11-14) for 7 Longshore Murloc Gills and 3 Murloc Eyes. They come in twos and flee: pull to the grass, Earthbind Totem, Stoneclaw Totem for adds. If these murlocs drop no gills, the map marks the west coast instead (24-28, 32-72): get them at the Gold Coast Quarry in loop 2 and hand in then", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=48.3, y=9.5},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={92742}, obj={1}, names={"Testing the Wells"}, text="East to the Jansen Stead, the farm beside the Furlbrows' cart (position approximate): use the Sample Kit at its well", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=59.0, y=18.0},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={151}, names={"Poor Old Blanchy"}, text="8 Handfuls of Oats from the Sacks of Oats on the farms. Missing some? The Jansen Stead and the pumpkin farm have several", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.0, y=20.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={64}, names={"The Forgotten Heirloom"}, text="Farmer Furlbrow, at the cart by the bridge", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=60.0, y=19.4},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={151}, names={"Poor Old Blanchy"}, text="Verna Furlbrow", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=59.9, y=19.4},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={9,22,38}, names={"The Killing Fields","Goretusk Liver Pie","Westfall Stew"}, text="On the way south to Saldean's Farm finish 20 Harvest Watchers (the fields west of the farm), 8 Goretusk Livers and the stew: 3 Stringy Vulture Meat, 3 Goretusk Snouts, 3 Murloc Eyes, 3 Okra", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.0, y=30.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={9}, names={"The Killing Fields"}, text="Farmer Saldean", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.0, y=31.2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={22,38}, names={"Goretusk Liver Pie","Westfall Stew"}, text="Salma Saldean", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=56.4, y=30.5},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={92909}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Ozwin Ironsprocket, in the stable. Parts missing? More harvesters stand in the fields right here", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=51.6, y=32.2},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={92910}, names={"Harvesting the Harvesters"}, text="Ozwin Ironsprocket (only if you found the Assembly). Do not start his engineering quest", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=51.6, y=32.2},
