  {t="A", seg=4, q={92747}, names={"Moonbrook Espionage"}, zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=52.5, y=53.1},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={92747}, names={"Moonbrook Espionage"}, text="Moonbrook, the ruined town in the south-west: collect 8 Suspicious Industrial Supplies (crates and barrels in and between the buildings; their spots are not in our data). The town is full of Defias: clear a building before you loot in it", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=42.5, y=70.0},
  {t="C", seg=4, q={14}, names={"The People's Militia"}, text="The Dagger Hills, south of Moonbrook: kill 15 Defias Highwaymen (17-18), 5 Pathstalkers and 5 Knuckledusters (15-17). They are above your level and stand in pairs: pull with Lightning Bolt from far away, Stoneclaw Totem to hold the second one, Earth Shock, and heal early. Level 17 makes this much easier, so take your time", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=45.7, y=76.3},
  {t="A", seg=4, q={103}, names={"Keeper of the Flame"}, text="Captain Grayson, the ghost at the Westfall Lighthouse on the island off the south-west tip (swim across). Skip his murloc quest: it needs murlocs from the north coast", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=30.0, y=86.0},
  {t="T", seg=4, q={103}, names={"Keeper of the Flame"}, text="Hand in the 5 Flasks of Oil at once. Short of oil? Harvest Golems in the fields north of Moonbrook drop it", zone="Westfall", map=1436, x=30.0, y=86.0},
  {t="H", seg=4, arg="Sentinel Hill"},
