  {t="T", seg=10, q={227}, names={"Morgan Ladimore"}, text="Commander Althea Ebonlocke. Do not take Mor'Ladim (228): he is elite", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.5, y=46.8},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={1243}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Watcher Backus, on the road at the north-east edge of town (74.8,44.2)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=74.8, y=44.2},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={1244}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Watcher Backus. The Defias Docket is in the west of Duskwood: you get it on the loop below", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=74.8, y=44.2},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={173}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="Calor, at the south-east edge of town (75.8,47.6)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=47.6},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={173}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="Brightwood Grove, west of Darkshire: kill 6 Nightbane Shadow Weavers (27-28, casters: Earth Shock the Shadow Bolts). Worgen stand close together: Stoneclaw Totem when two come", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=63.5, y=50.0},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={173}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="Calor", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=47.6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={221}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="Calor", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=47.6},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={221}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="12 Nightbane Dark Runners (28-29), a little further south in the same woods (60-68,39-78). They are fast melee: Frost Shock and Earthbind Totem, heal between pulls", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=64.0, y=58.0},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={221}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="Calor", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=47.6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={222}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="Calor. Vile Fangs and Tainted Ones are 29-31: they wait for the last loop", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=47.6},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={156}, names={"Gather Rot Blossoms"}, text="Tranquil Gardens Cemetery, south-east of Darkshire: Skeletal Horrors (79-82,56-62) drop the 8 Rot Blossoms. Stay out of the chapel", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=80.3, y=59.3},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={156}, names={"Gather Rot Blossoms"}, text="Tavernkeep Smitts", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=44.5},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={159}, names={"Juice Delivery"}, text="Tavernkeep Smitts: Zombie Juice for Abercrombie", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.8, y=44.5},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={96137}, names={"Ira's Dagger"}, text="Ira's Dagger (new in Forever, drops from the ghost of Ira Valor; the arrow is only a guess). Tick or skip this when it applies", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=60.0, y=60.0},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={96138}, names={"Merrick's Bow"}, text="Merrick's Bow (new in Forever, drops from the ghost of Merrick Valor; the arrow is only a guess). Tick or skip this when it applies", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=60.0, y=60.0},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={96137}, names={"Ira's Dagger"}, text="Only with Ira's Dagger. Take the south road west out of Darkshire. Young Black Ravagers (23-24) run beside it all the way (46-61,59-77); the 7 Black Ravagers (24-25) are fewer: they roam north of Darkshire and Brightwood (49-70,26-63), so kill any you saw on the worgen steps or pick them up when you are back", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=52.0, y=68.0},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={90}, names={"Seasoned Wolf Kabobs"}, text="10 Lean Wolf Flanks: Young Black Ravagers (23-24) beside the south road and Black Ravagers (24-25) drop them, the same wolves as the dagger quest. No dagger? Kill them anyway on this walk. They are grey to green: quick kills", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=52.0, y=66.0},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={1244}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Follow the south road to the Defias camp in the south-west (20-33,71-78). The Defias Docket is in the Defias Strongbox at 23.9,72.1. Night Runners, Night Blades and Enchanters (24-27) are easy now", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=23.9, y=72.1, path={{53.4,63.9},{52.8,60.9},{42.4,61.2},{36.8,59.4},{35.2,57.0},{31.4,57.0},{28.8,62.1},{25.0,66.0},{25.0,70.8}}},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={159}, names={"Juice Delivery"}, text="North through Raven Hill to Abercrombie's shack (28.1,31.5)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=28.1, y=31.5, path={{25.0,70.8},{25.0,66.0},{28.8,62.1},{32.8,55.5},{32.2,36.1},{29.2,31.6}}},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={133}, names={"Ghoulish Effigy"}, text="Abercrombie", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=28.1, y=31.5},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={133}, names={"Ghoulish Effigy"}, text="Ghouls in the eastern half of the cemetery below his hill (18-27,26-39): Flesh Eaters, Rotted Ones, Bone Chewers, Brain Eaters and Plague Spreaders all drop Ghoul Ribs (7 needed). Stoneform removes their disease", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=23.5, y=34.0},
