  {t="C", seg=10, q={134}, names={"Ogre Thieves"}, text="Go back south to the Vul'Gol Ogre Mound (32-40,67-84). Abercrombie's Crate stands at 33.4,76.3. Ogres here are 25-30: pull singles from the edge", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=33.4, y=76.3, path={{29.2,31.6},{32.2,36.1},{32.8,55.5},{28.8,62.1},{25.0,66.0},{25.0,72.0},{26.6,74.4}}},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={96138}, names={"Merrick's Bow"}, text="Only with Merrick's Bow: 8 Splinter Fist Warriors (29-30, at 32-37,69-80) and all 4 Splinter Fist Taskmasters (27-28, at 34-40,68-75). Warriors hit hard: Stoneclaw Totem first, Frost Shock and step back to heal. Leave the south end of the mound alone for now: Zzarc'Vul (33) is for the last loop", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=35.0, y=73.5},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={1244}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Ride the south road back east to Darkshire. Watcher Backus", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=74.8, y=44.2, path={{33.2,71.7},{33.2,69.6},{38.8,60.6},{49.2,61.2},{50.6,60.0},{63.0,58.8},{64.0,55.5},{68.0,49.9},{68.8,45.7},{72.4,46.6}}},
