  {t="A", seg=10, q={98447}, names={"The Valor Family"}, text="Sirra Von'Indi (new in Forever). Its text says it follows the two weapon quests; if she does not offer it, skip its steps. If you only finish the weapons on the last loop, take it then and decide whether one more Raven Hill trip is worth 2200 XP", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=72.6, y=47.5},
