  {t="A", seg=10, q={98}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="Commander Althea Ebonlocke. Stalvan is level 32: he is the very last fight of this segment", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=73.5, y=46.8},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={222}, names={"Worgen in the Woods"}, text="South of Darkshire (61-74,67-84): 8 Nightbane Vile Fangs (29-30) and 8 Nightbane Tainted Ones (30-31). Work in from the north edge, one at a time, Stoneclaw Totem when a second comes, Frost Shock runners", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=69.0, y=76.0},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={181}, names={"Look To The Stars"}, text="South road west to the Vul'Gol Ogre Mound. Zzarc'Vul (33) is at the south end of the mound (36-38,80-84) with Splinter Fist Enslavers (30-31). Clear the way in one ogre at a time, wait until he stands apart from the others, then Stoneclaw Totem, Frost Shock and keep moving; Healing Wave early. Loot the Ogre's Monocle. If he kills you twice, drop the quest. Finish Merrick's Bow here if it is still open", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=37.0, y=81.5},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={98447}, names={"The Valor Family"}, text="Only if Sirra gave you the second Valor Family quest. Go to Raven Hill village (17.4,54.0, near Jitters) with the dagger and the bow in your bags until \"Raven Hill investigated\" ticks. What appears there is not in the data: be ready for a fight", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=17.4, y=54.0},
  {t="C", seg=10, q={58}, names={"The Night Watch"}, text="North into the cemetery: 20 Plague Spreaders (27-28) around the eastern mausoleum and the graves below Abercrombie's hill (16-26,28-37). Stoneform removes their disease", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=22.8, y=33.2},
