  {t="C", seg=10, q={98}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="Stalvan Mistmantle (32) is in the cottage north of Darkshire at 77.3,36.2. Fetid Corpses (29-30) stand around it: kill the ones near the door first. Then full health and mana, Stoneclaw and Searing Totem at the door, pull him out, Earth Shock on cooldown, heal at half health. He drops the Mistmantle Family Ring. Too strong? Abandon the quest and move on", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=77.3, y=36.2, path={{80.3,40.3},{78.3,36.1}}},
  {t="T", seg=10, q={98}, names={"The Legend of Stalvan"}, text="Madame Eva, in her house (75.8,45.3)", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=75.8, y=45.3},
  {t="FLY", seg=10, arg="Stormwind", text="Felicia Maline, Darkshire", zone="Duskwood", map=1431, x=77.5, y=44.3},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={690}, names={"Malin's Request"}, text="Archmage Malin, in front of the mage tower in the Mage Quarter (50.5,87.5). Needs level 30: you should be 30 now. It sends you to Refuge Pointe in Arathi (segment 11)", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=50.5, y=87.5},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={92489}, names={"Power Overwhelming"}, text="High Sorcerer Andromath. Kill the Arcanic Enigma inside.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=37.6, y=81.6, dg=6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={92456}, names={"A Green Sample"}, text="Shylamiir. A Fel Infused Blossom from inside.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=31.5, y=63.0, dg=6},
  {t="A", seg=10, q={2928}, names={"Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators"}, text="Shoni the Shilent. 24 Robo-mechanical Guts from the robots inside.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=55.5, y=12.5, dg=7},
  {t="N", seg=10, arg="Take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge"},
  {t="N", seg=10, arg="Segment done. In the log: 270, 1248 and 98223 (Menethil), 472 (Dun Modr), 690 (Refuge Pointe), 94505 (Norric), 98219 (Southshore), 1026 (Ashenvale)", text="Your hearthstone stays in Darkshire until Southshore"},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={94789}, names={"Call of Air"}, text="Eldrun Stormbreaker (new in Forever). Needs level 30. It sends you to Veyric Thunderhame in Arathi", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=47.6, y=13.5},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={971}, names={"Knowledge in the Deeps"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=50.8, y=5.6, dg=4},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=11, text="Ironforge: Eldrun Stormbreaker (47.6, 13.5). Level 30 spells: Astral Recall is a second hearthstone with a 15 minute cooldown"},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Auction House: buy 1 Hillman's Cloak and 1 Bolt of Woolen Cloth for Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak (565)", text="The cloak is made by leatherworkers and not sold by vendors. None for sale at a fair price? Then do not take 565 in Southshore and skip its steps"},
  {t="FLY", seg=11, arg="Thelsamar", text="Gryth Thurden", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=55.5, y=47.7},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={94505}, names={"Call of Water"}, text="Run north from Thelsamar to Norric Lochthane (41.9,19.0). He takes the Shard of Water: you get the Water Totem", zone="Loch Modan", map=1432, x=41.9, y=19.0},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={472}, names={"Fall of Dun Modr"}, text="Through Dun Algaz into the Wetlands, then follow the road north all the way (Ghost Wolf) to Dun Modr. Longbraid the Grim and his dwarves stand outside the town on the west side (49.8,18.3). Dark Iron dwarves hold the town itself: stay out. Do not take his follow-ups (elite)", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.8, y=18.3},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={378}, names={"The Fury Runs Deep"}, zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=49.7, y=18.2, dg=3},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={161}, names={"A Dark Threat Looms"}, text="Ashlan Stonesmirk, the explosives expert among the dwarves at Dun Modr: the powder from the Stonewrought Dam. Do not take his follow-ups: they lead to an elite fight on the Thandol Span", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=50.0, y=18.2},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={637}, names={"Sully Balloo's Letter"}, text="Before you climb the Thandol Span: go down to the water under the broken western span and swim to the dwarf corpse on the bottom (Arathi map 44.3,92.9). Loot the Waterlogged Envelope and right-click it to start the quest. Then swim back to the Wetlands shore and walk up to the bridge", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=44.3, y=92.9},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={647}, names={"MacKreel's Moonshine"}, text="Foggy MacKreel sits on the stub of the broken western span, at the south (Wetlands) end of the Thandol Span (Arathi map 43.2,92.6). Needs level 28. His moonshine goes to Southshore", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=43.2, y=92.6},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Cross the Thandol Span north into the Arathi Highlands", text="Dark Iron dwarves (28-30) stand on the bridge: fight them one at a time or run past in Ghost Wolf"},
  {t="F", seg=11, arg="Refuge Pointe", text="Follow the road north, then east, to Refuge Pointe in the middle of the zone. Cedrik Prose is the gryphon master", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=45.7, y=46.1, path={{43.0,88.2},{47.2,81.9},{47.2,78.3},{48.2,76.8},{48.2,68.1},{41.0,57.0},{41.0,53.1},{42.4,51.0},{42.6,45.1},{45.4,42.7}}},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={690}, names={"Malin's Request"}, text="Skuerto, Refuge Pointe", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=46.6, y=47.0},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={681}, names={"Northfold Manor"}, text="Captain Nials, Refuge Pointe. Needs level 30", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=45.8, y=47.6},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={94789}, names={"Call of Air"}, text="Go north-east into the hills to Veyric Thunderhame (59.8,27.6; new in Forever, not on the Questie map). You get the Air Totem. Do not take his next quest: it needs Razorfen Kraul. Stay on the west side of the road here: Hammerfall, the Horde town, is further east", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=59.8, y=27.6, path={{45.8,42.7},{47.2,40.6},{51.2,40.0},{54.6,35.5},{59.6,34.6},{60.6,33.1}}},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={681}, names={"Northfold Manor"}, text="West across the hills to Northfold Manor (29-35,24-33): 10 Syndicate Highwaymen (30-31, stealthed around the fields) and 6 Syndicate Mercenaries (31-32, at the buildings). Stoneclaw Totem when two come, Earth Shock is wasted on them: use Frost Shock when they run", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=32.3, y=28.7, path={{60.6,33.1},{59.6,34.6},{54.6,35.5},{51.2,40.0},{49.8,40.3},{36.2,37.9},{35.6,32.2},{33.8,28.6}}},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={681}, names={"Northfold Manor"}, text="Back to Captain Nials at Refuge Pointe. Leave the other Refuge Pointe quests: you come back to Arathi in segment 15", zone="Arathi Highlands", map=1417, x=45.8, y=47.6},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Follow the road west through Thoradin's Wall into the Hillsbrad Foothills and on to Southshore", text="About 6 minutes in Ghost Wolf. Stay on the road past Durnholde Keep; Tarren Mill, north of the road, is a Horde town"},
  {t="F", seg=11, arg="Southshore", text="Darla Harris, the gryphon master north of the town", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=49.3, y=52.3},
