  {t="A", seg=11, q={564}, names={"Costly Menace"}, text="Darren Malvew (52.4,56.0). Needs level 30", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=52.4, y=56.0},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={565}, names={"Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak"}, text="Bartolo Ginsetti (49.4,55.5). Only if you have the Hillman's Cloak and the Bolt of Woolen Cloth", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=49.4, y=55.5},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Buy Soothing Spices (555) and Fine Thread (565) from Micha Yance, the trade goods vendor (48.9, 55.0)"},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={505}, names={"Syndicate Assassins"}, text="Magistrate Henry Maleb, in the town hall (48.1,59.1)", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=48.1, y=59.1},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={98059}, names={"Hillsbrad's Hoard"}, text="Captain McManus (new in Forever), north-west of town (46.5,50.1)", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=46.5, y=50.1},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={536}, names={"Down the Coast"}, text="The coast south-west of Southshore (36-49,63-73): 10 Torn Fin Tidehunters (31-32) and 10 Torn Fin Oracles (30-31). Earth Shock the Oracles' heals and lightning; murlocs run for help, so drop Earthbind Totem. Pull from the land side, never in the water", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=42.3, y=68.4, path={{44.2,52.5},{44.0,58.5},{40.8,63.3}}},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={536}, names={"Down the Coast"}, text="Lieutenant Farren Orinelle", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={559}, names={"Farren's Proof"}, text="Lieutenant Farren Orinelle", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={559}, names={"Farren's Proof"}, text="Back to the Western Strand. Every Torn Fin murloc drops Murloc Heads (10 needed); the Muckdwellers and Coastrunners further west (20-35,64-76) are only 28-30", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=30.0, y=70.0},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={98059}, names={"Hillsbrad's Hoard"}, text="North to Hillsbrad Fields. The town hall is the big building where the Hillsbrad Councilmen and Magistrate Burnside stand (about 29.7,41.6). Put the Sealed Company Request on the bookkeeping table inside. In Classic these farmers are friendly to the Alliance; if Forever made them hostile, go in and out fast. Horde players quest here", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=29.7, y=41.6},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={565}, names={"Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak"}, text="Only if you took 565. The yeti cave in the hills north-east of Hillsbrad Fields (42-47,25-34): Cave Yetis (30-31) and Ferocious Yetis (31-32) drop Yeti Fur, about one in three. 10 needed. Pull singles at the cave mouth, Stoneclaw Totem for a second one", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=44.5, y=30.0, path={{35.0,34.9},{38.6,34.9},{42.0,30.1},{46.3,31.6}}, cave=true},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={559}, names={"Farren's Proof"}, text="Back to Southshore. Lieutenant Farren Orinelle", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={560}, names={"Farren's Proof"}, text="Lieutenant Farren Orinelle", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={560}, names={"Farren's Proof"}, text="Marshal Redpath (49.5,58.7)", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=49.5, y=58.7},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={561}, names={"Farren's Proof"}, text="Marshal Redpath", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=49.5, y=58.7},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={561}, names={"Farren's Proof"}, text="Lieutenant Farren Orinelle", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={562}, names={"Stormwind Ho!"}, text="Lieutenant Farren Orinelle", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={98059}, names={"Hillsbrad's Hoard"}, text="Captain McManus", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=46.5, y=50.1},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={565}, names={"Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak"}, text="Bartolo Ginsetti (with the cloak, the wool bolt, Fine Thread and 10 Yeti Fur)", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=49.4, y=55.5},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={562}, names={"Stormwind Ho!"}, text="The coast south-east of Southshore (52-62,61-82): 10 Daggerspine Shorehunters (30-31) and 10 Daggerspine Sirens (31-32). Sirens cast: Earth Shock them. Shorehunters throw nets: fight them on land", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=56.9, y=69.2},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={98071}, names={"Brewer's Trade"}, text="Further south-east along the coast to Dun Garok, the dwarven fort (about 71,79). The dwarves are Alliance. Leave the Fallrook Varietal at the fireplace at the bottom of the fort and take a Sack of Homebrew Hops. The exact spot is not in the data", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=71.3, y=78.5},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={562}, names={"Stormwind Ho!"}, text="Lieutenant Farren Orinelle, Southshore", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4, path={{65.2,77.1},{64.0,75.3},{63.6,70.5},{62.0,68.1},{62.0,65.1},{59.8,61.5},{56.4,59.1}}},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={563}, names={"Reassignment"}, text="Lieutenant Farren Orinelle. The report goes to Stormwind Keep: you carry it until segment 14", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=51.5, y=58.4},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={98071}, names={"Brewer's Trade"}, text="Brewmeister Bilger", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=52.0, y=58.6},
  {t="N", seg=11, arg="Optional dungeon: City of Dalaran, levels 28-33", text="To get in you first need the Dalaran Sewer Key: Emissary Jacques in Southshore gives An Alarming Request, which sends you to the Image of Archmage Modera by Lordamere Lake (Silverpine Forest 68.4, 45.2). She gives Heart of Disruption and Starving Arcane, and with them the key. The way in is through the sewers on the north side of the city, then a portal at the end of a long pipe. One player with the key lets the whole group in. Many enemies here are immune to Arcane damage. Quests you picked up for it: Power Overwhelming, A Green Sample.", zone="Alterac Mountains", map=1416, x=8.5, y=59.2, dg=6, run=true},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={555}, names={"Soothing Turtle Bisque"}, text="Snapjaws (turtles, 30-31) swim in the river north-east of Southshore (56-69,14-57); start where the river meets the road east of town and work upstream until you have 10 Turtle Meat", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=63.5, y=40.0, path={{59.8,59.4},{60.8,57.9},{60.8,53.4},{64.8,48.1}}},
  {t="C", seg=11, q={505,564}, names={"Syndicate Assassins","Costly Menace"}, text="Cross west into the hills north of Southshore, which are the south edge of the Alterac Mountains. Sofera's Naze (the Syndicate camp at 58,68) and Corrahn's Dagger (48,82) hold the Syndicate Footpads (32-33) and Thieves (33-34): 12 and 8. Thieves are stealthed and stun: keep Lightning Shield up and Stoneclaw Totem down. Mountain Lions (32-33) and Hulking Mountain Lions (33-34) roam the slopes around and between both camps: 8 and 10. Rest to full after each pull; they are 2-3 levels above you", zone="Alterac Mountains", map=1416, x=55.0, y=72.0},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={510}, names={"Foreboding Plans"}, text="Syndicate Documents on the table in the camp: Sofera's Naze (Alterac 58.3,67.9) or Corrahn's Dagger (Alterac 47.9,82.2). Both camps have a copy", zone="Alterac Mountains", map=1416, x=58.3, y=67.9},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={511}, names={"Encrypted Letter"}, text="The same documents. Needs level 30", zone="Alterac Mountains", map=1416, x=58.3, y=67.9},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={510}, names={"Foreboding Plans"}, text="Back to Southshore (walk down, or Astral Recall). Magistrate Henry Maleb. Leave his next quest: Alterac comes back in segment 15", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=48.1, y=59.1},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={505}, names={"Syndicate Assassins"}, text="Magistrate Henry Maleb", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=48.1, y=59.1},
  {t="T", seg=11, q={511}, names={"Encrypted Letter"}, text="Loremaster Dibbs (50.6,57.1)", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=50.6, y=57.1},
  {t="A", seg=11, q={514}, names={"Letter to Stormpike"}, text="Loremaster Dibbs. For Ironforge", zone="Hillsbrad Foothills", map=1424, x=50.6, y=57.1},
