  {t="N", seg=12, arg="Cast Astral Recall (back to Astranaar)", text="Keep the hearthstone itself for the end of the furbolg run"},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1029}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Raene Wolfrunner, Astranaar (36.6,49.6)", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6, path={{52.6,50.7},{49.8,51.6},{48.2,54.0},{44.8,54.0},{43.2,48.4},{36.8,48.1}}},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1030}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Raene Wolfrunner. You now carry Dartol's Rod of Transformation", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1022}, names={"The Howling Vale"}, text="West to the Shrine of Aessina. Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow. Do not take Velinde Starsong: it sends you to Darnassus", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=22.2, y=53.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1031}, names={"The Branch of Cenarius"}, text="Illiyana. Do not take Satyr Slaying!: you are done with the satyrs", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=21.7, y=53.3},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={86757}, names={"Slowing the Orc Advance"}, text="Back east and south to Silverwind Refuge. Shandrina", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=49.4, y=67.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1030}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Krolg, the friendly furbolg on the south shore of Mystral Lake (50.8,75.1). Use Dartol's Rod of Transformation before you talk to him: he only speaks to furbolgs", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=50.8, y=75.1},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1045}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Krolg (still transformed)", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=50.8, y=75.1},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1045}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="The Bloodtooth camp just south-east of Krolg (54-56,75-80): 4 Bloodtooth Guards (27-28) and Ran Bloodtooth (30, at the back, 54.8,79.6). Easy at your level; taking damage ends the furbolg form", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=54.8, y=78.1},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1045}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Krolg (use the rod again)", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=50.8, y=75.1},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1046}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Krolg", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=50.8, y=75.1},
  {t="H", seg=12, arg="Astranaar", text="Hearthstone to Astranaar"},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1046}, names={"Raene's Cleansing"}, text="Raene Wolfrunner", zone="Ashenvale", map=1440, x=36.6, y=49.6},
  {t="N", seg=12, arg="Repair, buy food and water. Then go to Desolace on foot", text="South out of Astranaar to the Talondeep Path (the tunnel at Ashenvale 42.3,71.0). It comes out in Windshear Crag in the Stonetalon Mountains. Follow the road west and then south-west past Sun Rock Retreat (Horde: stay on the far side of the lake) into the Charred Vale, and leave it by the pass at its south end into Desolace. About 12 minutes in Ghost Wolf. Charred Vale mobs are 26-30"},
  {t="F", seg=12, arg="Nijel's Point", text="Nijel's Point is in the hills in the north-east of Desolace; the path up starts from the road east of the Thunder Axe Fortress. Baritanas Skyriver is the hippogryph master", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=64.7, y=10.5},
  {t="S", seg=12, arg="Nijel's Point", text="Innkeeper Lyshaerya", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.3, y=6.5},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1453}, names={"Reclaimers' Business in Desolace"}, text="Kreldig Ungor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1458,1454}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.","The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Kreldig Ungor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1387}, names={"Centaur Bounty"}, text="Corporal Melkins", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.7, y=10.9},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1382}, names={"Strange Alliance"}, text="Captain Pentigast", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.7, y=10.9},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={93224}, names={"Carved Centaur Totems"}, text="Captain Pentigast (new in Forever): 5 Carved Centaur Totems from centaurs of any clan", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.6, y=11.0},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1437}, names={"Vahlarriel's Search"}, text="Vahlarriel Demonslayer", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.4, y=11.8},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1437}, names={"Vahlarriel's Search"}, text="The Malem Chest in the wrecked wagon west of Nijel's Point, by the road (56.5,17.8)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=56.5, y=17.8},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1465}, names={"Vahlarriel's Search"}, text="The same chest", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=56.5, y=17.8},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1465}, names={"Vahlarriel's Search"}, text="Back up to Vahlarriel Demonslayer", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.4, y=11.8},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1438}, names={"Vahlarriel's Search"}, text="Vahlarriel Demonslayer", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.4, y=11.8},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={97284}, names={"Vahlarriel's Vengeance"}, text="Vahlarriel Demonslayer (new in Forever). The data has no giver for it; its text fits this moment. If she does not offer it yet, take it after the escort and skip its steps until then", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.4, y=11.8},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1458}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Sargeron, the satyr ruins east of Nijel's Point (71-81,9-30). Any Hatefury satyr (31-33) drops claws and horns: 10 each. Rogues and Shadowstalkers are stealthed, Hellcallers and Felsworn cast: Earth Shock, and Stoneclaw Totem when two come. Kill the Scorpashi Snappers you pass from now on and keep their venom", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=75.5, y=19.5},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1458}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Kreldig Ungor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1459}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Kreldig Ungor: 7 Scorpashi Venom and 3 Aged Kodo Hides", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1459}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="On the way west: Scorpashi Snappers (30-31) are all over the north of the zone; Aged Kodos (34-35) walk along the main road south of Thunder Axe (45-59,19-83). A kodo is a long fight at 33: Stoneclaw Totem, Frost Shock, and heal early. Hides do not always drop", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=56.0, y=22.0},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={5741}, names={"Sceptre of Light"}, text="Azore Aldamort, in the tower at Ethel Rethor on the west coast (38.9,27.2)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=38.9, y=27.2},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={6161}, names={"Claim Rackmore's Treasure!"}, text="Rackmore's Log, on the beach at the shipwreck just south-west of the tower (36.1,30.4)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.1, y=30.4},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1454}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Karnitol's Chest, in the same wreck (36.1,30.5)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.1, y=30.5},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1455}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Karnitol's Chest", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.1, y=30.5},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={6161}, obj={1}, names={"Claim Rackmore's Treasure!"}, text="Rackmore's Silver Key: Drysnap Crawlers and Pincers (33-35), the makrura on the beach and in the shallows south of the wreck (18-35,28-84)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=30.0, y=33.0},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={6161}, obj={2}, names={"Claim Rackmore's Treasure!"}, text="Rackmore's Golden Key: any Slitherblade naga. The Nagas and Sorceresses at the ruins just north of the tower (33-42,19-28) are 32-33. Sorceresses cast: Earth Shock", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=37.0, y=23.0},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={97284,5741}, names={"Vahlarriel's Vengeance","Sceptre of Light"}, text="East to Thunder Axe Fortress (52-58,21-33). Kill 4 each of Burning Blade Augurs, Reavers, Adepts and Felsworn (30-32). The Sceptre of Light is carried by the Burning Blade Seer on top of one of the watchtowers: fight your way up the ramp. Casters everywhere: Earth Shock, pull back to the door so you never fight three", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=55.0, y=27.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1438}, names={"Vahlarriel's Search"}, text="Dalinda Malem, held inside the fortress (54.9,26.1)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=54.9, y=26.1},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1439}, names={"Search for Tyranis"}, text="Dalinda Malem", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=54.9, y=26.1},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1439}, names={"Search for Tyranis"}, text="Tyranis Malem (36) is at 53.0,29.1, in the south-west part of the fortress. He is 2-3 levels above you and casts: full mana, Stoneclaw and Searing Totem, Earth Shock every cast, Healing Wave at half health. He drops Tyranis' Pendant. If he is too strong, come back after the coast loop", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=53.0, y=29.1},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1439}, names={"Search for Tyranis"}, text="Dalinda Malem", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=54.9, y=26.1},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1440}, names={"Return to Vahlarriel"}, text="Dalinda Malem. Clear the way to the gate first: it is an escort", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=54.9, y=26.1},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1440}, names={"Return to Vahlarriel"}, text="Walk Dalinda out of the fortress. Stay in front of her and kill what she pulls; it ends at the gate", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=56.5, y=28.5},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1440}, names={"Return to Vahlarriel"}, text="Back up to Nijel's Point. Vahlarriel Demonslayer", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.4, y=11.8},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={97284}, names={"Vahlarriel's Vengeance"}, text="Vahlarriel Demonslayer", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.4, y=11.8},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1455}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Kreldig Ungor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1456}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Kreldig Ungor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1459}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Kreldig Ungor (if the venom and hides are done; otherwise on your next visit)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1466}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Kreldig Ungor. Mannoroc Coven demons are 37-40: this is the last thing you do in Desolace", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={5741}, names={"Sceptre of Light"}, text="Back west to Azore Aldamort at Ethel Rethor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=38.9, y=27.2, path={{66.2,14.5},{64.6,16.6},{65.6,19.0},{65.6,28.0},{63.8,34.9},{47.6,34.3},{45.8,31.6},{41.0,31.0}}},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={6027}, names={"Book of the Ancients"}, text="Azore Aldamort. He gives you the Gem of the Serpent", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=38.9, y=27.2},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1456}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Swim north-west to Ranazjar Isle (28-35,6-17). Karnitol's Satchel drops from Slitherblade Tidehunters (36-37) and Sea Witches (35-36), about one in five. They are 2-4 levels above you: one at a time, on land, Earth Shock the witches. Get the Golden Key here if you still need it", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=30.5, y=11.0},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={6027}, names={"Book of the Ancients"}, text="Put the Gem of the Serpent in the hand of the Serpent Statue on the isle (its exact spot is not in the data; it is the large naga statue). Lord Kragaru (38) appears: clear the area first, full mana, Stoneclaw and Searing Totem, Frost Shock and keep distance while you heal. He drops the Book of the Ancients. Too strong? Abandon 6027", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=28.5, y=7.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={6161}, names={"Claim Rackmore's Treasure!"}, text="Rackmore's Chest on the isle (30.0,8.7): it needs both keys", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=30.0, y=8.7},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={6027}, names={"Book of the Ancients"}, text="Azore Aldamort", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=38.9, y=27.2},
  {t="H", seg=12, arg="Nijel's Point", text="Hearthstone or Astral Recall"},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1456}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Kreldig Ungor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1457}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Kreldig Ungor. The satchel goes to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge: you keep it until segment 14", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={261}, names={"Down the Scarlet Path"}, text="Brother Anton (66.5,7.9). Needs level 34: if you are not 34 yet, take it on your next visit here, before the last loop", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.5, y=7.9},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={5501}, names={"Bone Collector"}, text="Follow the road south to Kormek's Hut (62.3,39.0). Bibbly F'utzbuckle. Needs level 33", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=62.3, y=39.0},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={5821}, names={"Bodyguard for Hire"}, text="Cork Gizelton, with the kodo caravan (60.4,38.1). Only when the caravan is standing at Kormek's Hut; otherwise skip the three 5821 steps", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=60.4, y=38.1},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={5821}, names={"Bodyguard for Hire"}, text="Walk with the caravan past the Kolkar village and kill the centaurs that attack it. It ends south of the village", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.0, y=45.0, path={{63.2,37.6},{65.4,40.9},{65.2,43.9}}},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1387,93224}, names={"Centaur Bounty","Carved Centaur Totems"}, text="Kolkar Village, east of Kormek's Hut (68-75,39-52): Kolkar are 30-33. Every centaur drops Centaur Ears (15 needed); the Carved Centaur Totems (5) come from centaurs of any clan too. You get more of both from the Magram later", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=71.5, y=45.5},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={5561}, names={"Kodo Roundup"}, text="Road south to Scrabblescrew's Camp (60.9,61.9). Smeed Scrabblescrew", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=60.9, y=61.9},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={5821}, names={"Bodyguard for Hire"}, text="Smeed Scrabblescrew (only if you escorted the caravan)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=60.9, y=61.9},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={5943}, names={"Gizelton Caravan"}, text="Rigger Gizelton, with the caravan, when it stands at Scrabblescrew's Camp. Demons of 37-39 attack it at Mannoroc Coven: take it only if the caravan is here and you are at least 35; otherwise skip the three 5943 steps", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=60.3, y=38.2},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={5943}, names={"Gizelton Caravan"}, text="Walk with the caravan past Mannoroc Coven and kill what attacks it", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=56.0, y=72.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={5943}, names={"Gizelton Caravan"}, text="Smeed Scrabblescrew", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=60.9, y=61.9},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={5561,5501}, names={"Kodo Roundup","Bone Collector"}, text="The Kodo Graveyard, west of the camp (46-54,57-64). Pick up 10 Kodo Bones from the bone piles. Use the Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo (34-37) to tame it, walk it back to Smeed and talk to it there; five times, one kodo at a time", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=51.5, y=60.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={5561}, names={"Kodo Roundup"}, text="Smeed Scrabblescrew", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=60.9, y=61.9},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1382}, names={"Strange Alliance"}, text="Magram Village in the south-east (65-76,66-83). Kill Magram centaurs (32-36) until you are Friendly with the Gelkis Clan; each kill shows the gain in the chat log. How many it takes is not in the data: plan for a long grind. Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers at the north edge are 32-34; Earth Shock the Windchasers and Stormers. Stay away from Khan Jehn (37) in the middle. Finish your ears and totems here", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=69.5, y=74.5},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1382}, names={"Strange Alliance"}, text="West along the south road to Gelkis Village. Uthek the Wise stands at the north edge (36.2,79.2). The Gelkis no longer attack you", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.2, y=79.2, path={{66.6,70.5},{63.8,70.8},{62.4,73.8},{59.0,73.5},{57.2,70.8},{57.2,68.1},{53.2,61.5},{44.2,61.5},{42.0,65.1},{42.0,70.8},{38.2,76.2},{38.2,79.5}}},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1384}, names={"Raid on the Kolkar"}, text="Uthek the Wise: 10 Crude Charms from the Kolkar", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.2, y=79.2},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={6132}, names={"Get Me Out of Here!"}, text="North up the coast to the Valley of Spears. Melizza Brimbuzzle is held in the Maraudine camp (33.9,53.5). Needs level 34. Maraudine centaurs are 35-39: clear a path to her and out again before you accept", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=33.9, y=53.5},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={6132}, names={"Get Me Out of Here!"}, text="Escort Melizza east out of the valley. Stay beside her; Stoneclaw Totem holds what attacks her", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=40.0, y=57.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={6132}, names={"Get Me Out of Here!"}, text="Hornizz Brimbuzzle, at the camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard (47.8,61.8)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=47.8, y=61.8},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={6134}, names={"Ghost-o-plasm Round Up"}, text="Hornizz Brimbuzzle. For the last loop", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=47.8, y=61.8},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={5501}, names={"Bone Collector"}, text="Back north along the road to Kormek's Hut. Bibbly F'utzbuckle", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=62.3, y=39.0, path={{56.6,62.4},{57.8,60.6},{59.8,56.4},{58.2,52.5},{58.0,40.3},{61.6,37.6}}},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1384}, names={"Raid on the Kolkar"}, text="Kolkar Village again: Crude Charms drop from every Kolkar, best from Windchasers and Scouts", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=71.5, y=45.5, path={{62.6,37.6},{65.6,37.9},{68.0,35.8},{69.6,38.2},{69.8,42.7}}},
  {t="H", seg=12, arg="Nijel's Point", text="Hearthstone or Astral Recall"},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1387}, names={"Centaur Bounty"}, text="Corporal Melkins. Take Down the Scarlet Path (261) from Brother Anton now if you could not before", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.7, y=10.9},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={93224}, names={"Carved Centaur Totems"}, text="Captain Pentigast. His hand-in text hints at a follow-up delivery to a clan (not in the data): if he offers one for the Gelkis, take it along to Uthek on the next loop", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.6, y=11.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1384}, names={"Raid on the Kolkar"}, text="The long run south-west to Uthek the Wise at Gelkis Village (36.2,79.2): road south past Kormek's Hut and the Kodo Graveyard, then south-west. Check that you are still Friendly", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.2, y=79.2, path={{66.6,13.9},{64.6,16.6},{65.6,19.0},{65.6,28.0},{63.8,34.9},{49.6,34.3},{47.2,36.1},{46.6,45.4},{42.6,54.6},{42.0,70.8},{38.2,76.2},{38.0,79.8}}},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1370}, names={"Stealing Supplies"}, text="Uthek the Wise", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.2, y=79.2},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1370}, names={"Stealing Supplies"}, text="East to Magram Village: 6 bags of Crudely Dried Meat from the Sacks of Meat beside the tents (65.8,80.5 / 69.2,77.3 / 70.9,75.4 / 73.5,73.8 and more)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=70.5, y=76.5, path={{38.2,79.5},{38.2,76.2},{42.0,70.8},{42.0,65.4},{43.2,63.6},{49.6,67.8},{56.2,66.9},{57.2,70.8},{59.6,73.8},{62.4,73.8},{63.8,70.8},{66.6,70.5}}},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={261,6134}, names={"Down the Scarlet Path","Ghost-o-plasm Round Up"}, text="The Valley of Bones, south of Magram Village (58-65,82-92). Undead Ravagers are 37-38 and you need 30: one at a time, Stoneclaw Totem, Frost Shock and back off to heal. If they are still orange and each fight nearly kills you, abandon 261. For Hornizz: place a Ghost Magnet between the two giant skeletons (63.5,91.6), step back and kill the Magrami Spectres (38-39) that walk to it one by one; 8 Ghost-o-plasms", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=63.0, y=89.0},
  {t="C", seg=12, q={1466}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Mannoroc Coven, west of the valley (51-58,69-85): 10 Felhound Brains from Mage Hunters (38-39, at 53-58,73-79), 10 Nether Wings from Nether Sorceresses (39-40) and 10 Doomwarder Blood from Doomwarder Captains (38), both at the south end around 51.7,83.4. Felhounds drain mana: kill them fast with shocks. This is the hardest step of the segment: if you cannot kill a Sorceress at 35, abandon 1466; segment 14 then has only the satchel (1457) for Ironforge", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=53.0, y=78.0},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1370}, names={"Stealing Supplies"}, text="Uthek the Wise, Gelkis Village. Do not take Ongeku (1373): the Draenethyst Shard is in the Swamp of Sorrows on the other continent, and the route does not come back here afterwards", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=36.2, y=79.2},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={6134}, names={"Ghost-o-plasm Round Up"}, text="Hornizz Brimbuzzle, Kodo Graveyard", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=47.8, y=61.8},
  {t="H", seg=12, arg="Nijel's Point", text="Hearthstone or Astral Recall"},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={261}, names={"Down the Scarlet Path"}, text="Brother Anton. Do not take his next quest: it sends you to the Scarlet Monastery line", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.5, y=7.9},
  {t="T", seg=12, q={1466}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Kreldig Ungor", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="A", seg=12, q={1467}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Kreldig Ungor. Leftwitch's Package goes to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge (segment 14)", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=66.2, y=9.6},
  {t="N", seg=12, arg="Segment done. In the log: 525, 563, 1179, 1264, 1457, 1467", text="Next: fly from Nijel's Point to Astranaar. Your hearthstone stays at Nijel's Point"},
  {t="N", seg=13, arg="Have 3 Soothing Spices in your bags", text="You bought them in Southshore earlier. None left? No problem: Helenia Olden sells them in Theramore (66.4, 51.5), you then do Jarl's two quests on the loop out of Theramore later in this segment."},
  {t="FLY", seg=13, arg="Astranaar", text="Baritanas Skyriver, the hippogryph master at Nijel's Point", zone="Desolace", map=1443, x=64.7, y=10.5},
  {t="N", seg=13, arg="Walk from Astranaar to Ratchet", text="Ghost Wolf all the way. Take the road east from Astranaar, then the road south into the Barrens. The border gate (Mor'shan Rampart) is a Horde guard post: do not stop, run straight through or around the side. In the Barrens stay on the road south, leave it before the Crossroads (a Horde town, pass it well to the east) and follow the road east to Ratchet on the coast. Ratchet is neutral. This is Classic geography, not re-checked.", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.1, y=37.2},
  {t="F", seg=13, arg="Ratchet", text="Bragok, the flight master near the dock", zone="The Barrens", map=1413, x=63.1, y=37.2},
  {t="N", seg=13, arg="Walk south to the Great Lift and on to the Mirage Raceway", text="From Ratchet go back west to the main road and follow it south through the whole Barrens (pass Camp Taurajo, a Horde camp, at a distance) to the Great Lift at the south end. Ride the lift down into Thousand Needles and follow the canyon road east, past Freewind Post (Horde, up on a mesa: just keep walking), until the canyon opens into the white salt flats. The Mirage Raceway is in the middle of the flats.", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.0, y=77.0},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1179}, names={"The Brassbolts Brothers"}, text="Wizzle Brassbolts, on the gnome side of the raceway", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.1, y=77.1},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1105}, names={"Hardened Shells"}, text="Wizzle Brassbolts", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.1, y=77.1},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1104}, names={"Salt Flat Venom"}, text="Fizzle Brassbolts, next to him", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.1, y=77.1},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1106}, names={"Martek the Exiled"}, text="Fizzle Brassbolts. A letter for Martek in the Badlands: keep it, a later segment hands it in.", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.1, y=77.1},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1110}, names={"Rocket Car Parts"}, text="Kravel Koalbeard, a few steps away", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=77.8, y=77.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={5762}, names={"Hemet Nesingwary"}, text="Kravel Koalbeard. A crate for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn: keep it for the next segment.", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=77.8, y=77.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1111}, names={"Wharfmaster Dizzywig"}, text="Kravel Koalbeard. An order for Wharfmaster Dizzywig in Ratchet: keep it for the next Kalimdor trip.", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=77.8, y=77.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1176}, names={"Load Lightening"}, text="Pozzik, on the goblin side of the track", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=80.2, y=75.9},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1175}, names={"A Bump in the Road"}, text="Trackmaster Zherin, at the east end of the goblin side", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=81.6, y=78.0},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1105,1104,1175}, obj={0,0,1}, names={"Hardened Shells","Salt Flat Venom","A Bump in the Road"}, text="North half of the flats. Sparkleshell Tortoises (30-31) and Snappers (34-35) drop the shells, Scorpid Reavers (31-32) the venom, and the Saltstone Basilisks (30-31) only live up here: kill 10. Salt Flats Scavengers (the vultures here) drop Hollow Vulture Bones, Saltstone Crystalhides count for Zherin, and every Rocket Car Rubble pile on the ground holds car parts: pick up all you pass. Everything here is below your level: fight with Lightning Shield up and do not bother with totems.", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=76.0, y=60.0},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1175,1176,1110}, names={"A Bump in the Road","Load Lightening","Rocket Car Parts"}, text="South half, below the raceway. Saltstone Gazers (34-35) are only down here: kill 6. Finish the 10 Crystalhides, get the rest of the 10 vulture bones from the Salt Flats Vultures and keep picking up rubble until you have 30 Rocket Car Parts. Scorpid Terrors and Sparkleshell Borers here also drop venom and shells if you are short.", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.0, y=85.0},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1105}, names={"Hardened Shells"}, text="Wizzle Brassbolts", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.1, y=77.1},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1104}, names={"Salt Flat Venom"}, text="Fizzle Brassbolts", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=78.1, y=77.1},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1110}, names={"Rocket Car Parts"}, text="Kravel Koalbeard", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=77.8, y=77.3},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1176}, names={"Load Lightening"}, text="Pozzik", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=80.2, y=75.9},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1178}, names={"Goblin Sponsorship"}, text="Pozzik. A message for Gazlowe in Ratchet: keep it for the next Kalimdor trip.", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=80.2, y=75.9},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1175}, names={"A Bump in the Road"}, text="Trackmaster Zherin", zone="Thousand Needles", map=1441, x=81.6, y=78.0},
  {t="N", seg=13, arg="Walk south into Tanaris to Gadgetzan", text="Leave the flats by the pass in the south wall and follow the road south to the goblin town. The desert animals near the road are level 40 and up: stay on the road and keep moving.", zone="Tanaris", map=1446, x=51.0, y=29.3},
  {t="F", seg=13, arg="Gadgetzan", text="Bera Stonehammer, the Alliance gryphon master on the north side of town. Nothing else to do here yet.", zone="Tanaris", map=1446, x=51.0, y=29.3},
  {t="N", seg=13, arg="Walk back north to the Dustwallow road", text="Back through the flats and the canyon, up the Great Lift and north on the Barrens road. A side road branches off east into Dustwallow Marsh a little north of the lift. The first thing on it is the burnt-out Shady Rest Inn. The marsh animals are 35-38: pull one at a time, Stoneform cures the spider poison.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=29.7, y=47.6},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1284}, names={"Suspicious Hoofprints"}, text="The Suspicious Hoofprint, a mark on the ground in front of the inn ruins", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=29.7, y=47.6},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1253}, names={"The Black Shield"}, text="The Black Shield, hanging over the fireplace of the ruins", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=29.6, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1252}, names={"Lieutenant Paval Reethe"}, text="The Theramore Guard Badge, lying on the floor boards of the ruins", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=29.8, y=48.2},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1177}, names={"Hungry!"}, text="Mudcrush Durtfeet, an ogre standing by the road north-east of the inn, just south of Brackenwall Village. Brackenwall is a Horde ogre town: do not go further north than him. If he is hostile to you or you cannot reach him, skip his quest (this step, the murloc step and the hand-in).", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=35.1, y=38.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1218}, names={"Soothing Spices"}, text="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl at the Swamplight Manor, the lonely house in the north of the marsh. Follow the road east and turn north.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=55.4, y=26.3},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1218}, names={"Soothing Spices"}, text="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl. Hand him the 3 Soothing Spices. (No spices: skip this and the next step and come back on the loop out of Theramore.)", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=55.4, y=26.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1206}, names={"Jarl Needs Eyes"}, text="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=55.4, y=26.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1219}, names={"The Orc Report"}, text="The Loose Dirt mound behind Jarl's house. It gives you the Spy's Report.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=55.4, y=25.9},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1177}, names={"Hungry!"}, text="Mirefin murlocs (35-38) on the north coast, straight north of Jarl's house, and on the small islands further north-east. About one in three drops a head; you need 8. They come in twos and threes and run when low: Earthbind Totem down first, Stoneclaw Totem if a third joins.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=56.8, y=15.6},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1222}, names={"Stinky's Escape"}, text="\"Stinky\" Ignatz, standing in the swamp west of the murloc beach", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=46.9, y=17.5},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1222}, names={"Stinky's Escape"}, text="Escort: walk beside Stinky while he looks for his bogbean plant and kill whatever attacks him (swamp animals, 35-38). Heal yourself, not him, and stay close so the attackers pick you. When he thanks you the quest is complete; the hand-in is in Theramore. If he dies, abandon the quest and take it again from him.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=46.9, y=17.5},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1206}, names={"Jarl Needs Eyes"}, text="Darkmist Cavern, in the north-west corner of the marsh. Darkmist Spiders (35-36), Recluses (36-37) and Silkspinners (38-39) all drop the eyes; you need 20. Work inwards from the entrance, one spider at a time, and Stoneform when the poison stacks. Leave the rare Darkmist Widow (40) alone.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=32.8, y=22.2},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1177}, names={"Hungry!"}, text="Mudcrush Durtfeet, south of the cavern", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=35.1, y=38.3},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1206}, names={"Jarl Needs Eyes"}, text="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl. Do not take Jarl Needs a Blade: it wants a crafted sword.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=55.4, y=26.3},
  {t="F", seg=13, arg="Theramore", text="Follow the road south-east and across the long bridge to Theramore Isle. Baldruc, the gryphon master, is in the south-east of town.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=67.5, y=51.3},
  {t="S", seg=13, arg="Theramore", text="Innkeeper Janene, in the inn at the north end of town", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.6, y=45.2},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1222}, names={"Stinky's Escape"}, text="Morgan Stern, in the same inn", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.3, y=45.5},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1204}, names={"Mudrock Soup and Bugs"}, text="Morgan Stern: Mudrock Soup and Bugs (needs level 33). The turtles are on the coast north of Theramore: you pass it on the loop below", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.3, y=45.5},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1219}, names={"The Orc Report"}, text="A Theramore Lieutenant: the officers standing at the town gates", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=65.1, y=47.2},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1220}, names={"Captain Vimes"}, text="The same Theramore Lieutenant", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=65.1, y=47.2},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1220}, names={"Captain Vimes"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes, top floor of Foothold Citadel, the big barracks in the east of town", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1253}, names={"The Black Shield"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1319}, names={"The Black Shield"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1284}, names={"Suspicious Hoofprints"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1302}, names={"James Hyal"}, text="Clerk Lendry, on the same floor of Foothold Citadel: James Hyal", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=67.9, y=48.2},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1252}, names={"Lieutenant Paval Reethe"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1259}, names={"Lieutenant Paval Reethe"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1259}, names={"Lieutenant Paval Reethe"}, text="Adjutant Tesoran, in the same room", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.0, y=48.1},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1285}, names={"Daelin's Men"}, text="Adjutant Tesoran", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.0, y=48.1},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1285}, names={"Daelin's Men"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1286}, names={"The Deserters"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1264}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Commander Samaul, in the same room", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.0, y=48.7},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1265}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Commander Samaul", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.0, y=48.7},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1319}, names={"The Black Shield"}, text="Caz Twosprocket, the gnome at the smithy in the west of town", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=64.8, y=50.4},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1320}, names={"The Black Shield"}, text="Caz Twosprocket", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=64.8, y=50.4},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1320}, names={"The Black Shield"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes, back up in the citadel", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1265}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Sentry Point, the first guard tower on the road outside Theramore, just past the bridge. Walk up to it until the quest says it is explored.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=59.9, y=40.9},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1265}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Archmage Tervosh, in Lady Jaina Proudmoore's tower in the middle of Theramore", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.4, y=49.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1266}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Archmage Tervosh", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.4, y=49.3},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1204}, names={"Mudrock Soup and Bugs"}, text="8 Forked Mudrock Tongues. On the way north leave the road to the east: Mudrock Spikeshells and Tortoises (36-38) walk the beach and the shallows of the north-east coast. Only about one in four has a forked tongue, so this is 30 or more kills: it is the grind of this segment, with a quest reward on top. They hit slowly and hard: Stoneskin Totem down, shocks and melee, Healing Wave between kills. Had enough? Press Skip here and on the hand-in", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=61.1, y=18.4},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1266}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Private Hendel, at the tents beside the road in the north of the marsh, west of Jarl's house. (Still owe Jarl his spices and eyes? Do his two quests now, the cavern is west of here.)", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=45.2, y=24.7},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1324}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Private Hendel", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=45.2, y=24.7},
  {t="C", seg=13, q={1324}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Hendel (35) and the two guards beside him turn hostile. Fight Hendel himself: Stoneclaw Totem for the guards, Earth Shock on cooldown. He gives up when he is nearly dead. If Archmage Tervosh appears next to him afterwards, hand the quest in to him right there.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=45.2, y=24.7},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1286}, names={"The Deserters"}, text="Balos Jacken at the Lost Point tower, south-east of the Shady Rest Inn. Take the road back west and turn south. Attack him (38): the deserters around him join in, so drop Stoneclaw Totem and keep hitting Jacken only. He surrenders when he is nearly dead and then talks to you. Heal up before you start.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=36.1, y=54.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1287}, names={"The Deserters"}, text="Balos Jacken", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=36.1, y=54.3},
  {t="H", seg=13, arg="Theramore", text="Hearthstone"},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1287}, names={"The Deserters"}, text="Captain Garran Vimes. If he offers Vimes's Report (a short new quest to Lady Jaina, 290 XP), take it and hand it in at the tower in a moment.", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=68.2, y=48.6},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1204}, names={"Mudrock Soup and Bugs"}, text="Morgan Stern, in the inn. Do not take the spider follow-up: it is not on this route", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.3, y=45.5},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1324}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Archmage Tervosh in Jaina's tower (unless you already handed it in at the tents)", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.4, y=49.3},
  {t="A", seg=13, q={1267}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Archmage Tervosh", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.4, y=49.3},
  {t="T", seg=13, q={1267}, names={"The Missing Diplomat"}, text="Lady Jaina Proudmoore, standing beside him", zone="Dustwallow Marsh", map=1445, x=66.3, y=49.0},
  {t="N", seg=13, arg="Take the boat from Theramore to Menethil Harbor", text="The dock is at the south-east edge of town. You keep for later: 1106 (Martek, Badlands), 5762 (Hemet Nesingwary, Stranglethorn), 1111 and 1178 (Ratchet), 525 (Southshore), 563 (Stormwind), 1457 and 1467 (Ironforge). Your hearthstone stays in Theramore."},
  {t="FLY", seg=14, arg="Ironforge", text="You arrive on the Menethil Harbor dock. Shellei Brondir, the gryphon master, is just inside the town.", zone="Wetlands", map=1437, x=9.5, y=59.7},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1467}, names={"Reagents for Reclaimers Inc."}, text="Roetten Stonehammer, at Reclaimers Inc. in the Hall of Explorers", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=70.0, y=21.3},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1457}, names={"The Karnitol Shipwreck"}, text="Roetten Stonehammer", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=70.0, y=21.3},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={707}, names={"Ironband Wants You!"}, text="Prospector Stormpike, in the library at the back of the Hall of Explorers. Keep it: Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan is the first stop of the next segment.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=74.6, y=11.7},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={1050}, names={"Mythology of the Titans"}, text="Librarian Mae Paledust in the Hall of Explorers. Mythology of the Titans is in the Library wing.", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=75.0, y=12.5, dg=8},
  {t="TRAIN", seg=14, text="Eldrun Stormbreaker: learn your level 36 spells", zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=47.6, y=13.5},
  {t="N", seg=14, arg="Optional dungeon: Scarlet Monastery, levels 30-46", text="The monastery is in the north-east corner of Tirisfal Glades, deep in Horde land: from Southshore ride north through Alterac and the Western Plaguelands, or west along the north shore of Lordamere Lake. Four wings, each its own run: Graveyard (30-38), Library (33-41), Armory (36-44) and Cathedral (38-46). Raleigh the Devout in Southshore gives In the Name of the Light (the four wing bosses), but only after a letter from Brother Anton at Nijel's Point in Desolace. Magus Olvek (Alterac Mountains 9.8, 63.0, by Dalaran) gives Past Due, a book from the monastery. Quests you picked up for it: Mythology of the Titans.", zone="Tirisfal Glades", map=1420, x=82.6, y=33.8, dg=8, run=true},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1050}, names={"Mythology of the Titans"}, zone="Ironforge", map=1455, x=75.0, y=12.5, dg=8},
  {t="N", seg=14, arg="Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town to Stormwind", text="The tram station is at the back of Tinker Town. You come out in Stormwind's Dwarven District."},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={563}, names={"Reassignment"}, text="Major Samuelson, in Stormwind Keep", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=75.8, y=36.7},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={2928}, names={"Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=55.5, y=12.5, dg=7},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={212}, names={"A Meal Served Cold"}, text="Angus Stern, the cook in the Blue Recluse tavern in the Mage Quarter. The haunch comes from a Cold Eye Basilisk in Stranglethorn, later in this segment; the hand-in waits for a later Stormwind visit.", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=51.8, y=93.6},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={92489}, names={"Power Overwhelming"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=48.8, y=88.1, dg=6},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={92456}, names={"A Green Sample"}, zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=31.5, y=63.0, dg=6},
  {t="FLY", seg=14, arg="Darkshire", text="Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master in the Trade District", zone="Stormwind City", map=1453, x=71.0, y=72.5},
  {t="N", seg=14, arg="Walk east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows", text="Leave Darkshire on the road east. It winds through Deadwind Pass (stay on the road, the mobs beside it are far above you) and comes out in the swamp. Watcher Biggs camps just south of the road, right after the zone border. Stonard, further east, is a Horde town: stay away from it.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.7, y=59.8},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={1396}, names={"Encroaching Wildlife"}, text="Watcher Biggs", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.7, y=59.8},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={93176}, names={"My Little Friends"}, text="Amaryllis Webb, a short way north-west of Biggs. New Forever quest: she gives you an Entomology Starter Kit. Read the notes in the kit, they say how to catch the three bugs (Arbor Tarantula, Hay Weevil, Flesh Picker). Where the bugs are is not in my data.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=25.0, y=54.2},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={93585}, names={"This Light of Mine"}, text="Father Tuttle, at the bridge on the road west of Biggs. New Forever escort quest.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=22.0, y=50.6},
  {t="C", seg=14, q={93585}, names={"This Light of Mine"}, text="Escort Father Tuttle north to the Harborage, the draenei village on the island in the north-west of the swamp. Lost Ones (34-37) attack on the way: stay beside him, drop Stoneclaw Totem when two come, Earth Shock the casters. If he dies, abandon the quest and take it again at the bridge.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.0, y=31.4},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={93585}, names={"This Light of Mine"}, text="At the Harborage. The data does not say who takes the hand-in: it may complete by itself on arrival, otherwise look for the NPC with the yellow question mark (most likely Magtoor or Father Tuttle himself).", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.0, y=31.4},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={1389}, names={"Draenethyst Crystals"}, text="Magtoor, the draenei leader at the Harborage", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.0, y=31.4},
  {t="C", seg=14, q={1396}, names={"Encroaching Wildlife"}, text="The animals between the Harborage and Biggs' camp: 8 Young Sawtooth Crocolisks (35-36, in and beside the water), 10 Sorrow Spinners (spiders, 36-37) and 10 Swamp Jaguars (36-37). Use the kit from Amaryllis on any quest bug you see on the way. Stoneform removes the spider poison.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=32.0, y=44.0},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1396}, names={"Encroaching Wildlife"}, text="Watcher Biggs", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.7, y=59.8},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={1421}, names={"The Lost Caravan"}, text="Watcher Biggs", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.7, y=59.8},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={1392}, names={"Noboru the Cudgel"}, text="Noboru the Cudgel (39), a Lost One who walks the swamp north of the road, about half way to the east end, with two followers. Kill the followers first (Stoneclaw Totem, Earthbind if you need to back off), then him, and right-click the Noboru's Cudgel he drops to start the quest. Not there? Do the Fallow Sanctuary first and look again on the way back.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=55.7, y=34.4},
  {t="C", seg=14, q={1389,1421}, names={"Draenethyst Crystals","The Lost Caravan"}, text="The Fallow Sanctuary, the Lost One village in the north-east. The Draenethyst Crystals are blue crystals standing among the huts and campfires: collect 6. The Caravan Chest with the Wizards' Reagents is at the back of the village (64.5, 18.3). Lost Ones here are 36-38 and stand close together: pull with Lightning Bolt from range, one at a time, and avoid the Lost One Chieftain (39, rare).", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=62.0, y=22.0},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={1393}, names={"Galen's Escape"}, text="Galen Goodward, in the cage right beside the Caravan Chest. Clear the Lost Ones around the cage before you talk to him.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=65.5, y=18.2},
  {t="C", seg=14, q={1393}, names={"Galen's Escape"}, text="Escort Galen out of the village. Walk ahead of him and kill what he meets. When he says goodbye the escort part is done.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=65.5, y=18.2},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1393}, names={"Galen's Escape"}, text="Galen's Strongbox, in his little camp in the middle of the swamp north of Stonard (stay north of the Horde town)", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=47.8, y=39.8},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1389}, names={"Draenethyst Crystals"}, text="Magtoor at the Harborage", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.0, y=31.4},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1392}, names={"Noboru the Cudgel"}, text="Magtoor (only if Noboru dropped the cudgel)", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.0, y=31.4},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={1421}, names={"The Lost Caravan"}, text="Watcher Biggs. Do not take the follow-up, Driftwood: the route does it on a later visit.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=26.7, y=59.8},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={93176}, names={"My Little Friends"}, text="Amaryllis Webb, if you caught all three bugs. If the kit's notes send you to places outside the swamp, press Skip here and abandon the quest when you leave.", zone="Swamp of Sorrows", map=1435, x=25.0, y=54.2},
  {t="N", seg=14, arg="Walk back to Duskwood and south into Stranglethorn Vale", text="Back west through Deadwind Pass to Darkshire, then the road south-west out of Duskwood into the jungle. The Rebel Camp is on the left of the road right after the border.", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=38.0, y=3.3},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={203}, names={"The Second Rebellion"}, text="Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=38.0, y=3.3},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={204}, names={"Bad Medicine"}, text="Sergeant Yohwa", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=38.0, y=3.3},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={210}, names={"Krazek's Cookery"}, text="Corporal Kaleb. A broken pot for Krazek in Booty Bay.", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=37.7, y=3.3},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={215}, names={"Jungle Secrets"}, text="Private Thorsen. He walks out of the camp on a patrol and gets ambushed by two Kurzen soldiers on the path: follow him, kill the two attackers, then he offers the quest. If he is not in camp, wait a few minutes for him to come back.", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=38.0, y=3.4},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={215}, names={"Jungle Secrets"}, text="Lieutenant Doren at the Rebel Camp", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=38.0, y=3.0},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={200}, names={"Bookie Herod"}, text="Lieutenant Doren", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=38.0, y=3.0},
  {t="T", seg=14, q={5762}, names={"Hemet Nesingwary"}, text="Hemet Nesingwary at Nesingwary's Expedition, the hunters' camp a short walk south-west of the Rebel Camp", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=35.7, y=10.8},
  {t="A", seg=14, q={583}, names={"Welcome to the Jungle"}, text="Barnil Stonepot, at the same camp", zone="Stranglethorn Vale", map=1434, x=35.7, y=10.5},
